-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- What each one is made of
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Every Gu in the game is refinable - 0038 said so and a test holds it. The
-- base is a gathering material and the secondary a beast material, both chosen
-- from what the Gu's own Path agrees with, and the secondary from something
-- within two ranks of the Gu so the price is one a cultivator at that rank can
-- actually pay.

