-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Where each one is found
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- A Path's Gu are found where that Path's materials grow. Four Paths grow
-- nothing anywhere and are placed by what the region is for instead: Shadow in
-- the Southern Border, where the game already drops Moonshadow Gu; Sword and
-- Painting in the Central Continent; Theft in the Western Desert, which is
-- Thieving Heaven's desert.
--
-- Weight is rarity, so the 35 hand-placed Gu keep the top of the band and a
-- legendary is one roll in twenty against a common. Nothing above the gate
-- appears here at all.

